Hi
An example where reduce.capthist (specifically reduce.traps) doesn't correctly handle sightings. You may need to first 'reduce' the capthist (not including markocc), assign a reduced markocc to the reduced capthist, independently compress the Tu and Tm matrices,and then addSightings. In your case (138 detectors, 72 occasions) I think this works to compress Tu by 2:
Tu <- apply(array(Tu,dim = c(138,2,36), c(1,3), sum)
Murray

